  ('254f0833-1059-5418-9c94-9bf3913fc2a1', 'In the body, the pathogen is the structure that can cause disease.', 'In the body this is the structure that can cause disease.', '在体内，病原体就是承担这一功能的结构。'),
  ('6a3f9080-429b-53b8-beca-cd588e015750', 'The discharge summary kept prolapse among the principal diagnoses.', 'The discharge summary still listed downward displacement of an organ from its place as a main diagnosis.', '出院小结把脱垂留在主要诊断里。'),
  ('4f62bd26-f669-55fe-b0ae-573971f9494f', 'Lymph from the inflamed area drained toward the fungus.', 'Lymph from the inflamed area moved toward this structure (yeast or mold that can infect tissue).', '炎症区的淋巴向真菌回流。'),
  ('8f1dbb0b-9d63-57f6-ab06-771d2ee07278', 'Falling output and wet lungs made malfunction the immediate danger.', 'Low output and wet lungs made failure of an organ or device to work normally the immediate danger.', '心输出下降和肺水肿使功能失调成为眼前的危险。'),
  ('87b0471d-6f2a-51d1-b29e-e289f7c9a766', 'The meter reading fitted obesity and explained the new confusion.', 'The glucose reading fitted excess body fat that raises health risk and explained the confusion.', '血糖读数符合肥胖，也解释了新出现的意识混乱。'),
  ('95546827-6efd-53da-ba66-ea460a6591ee', 'In the body this presented as bacterium rather than an unrelated distant change.', 'In the body this presented as prokaryotic microbe, some of which cause disease, not an unrelated distant change.', '在体内，表现是细菌，而不是无关的远处改变。'),
  ('58a5ddce-6a07-5b49-ae95-373094ea29fa', 'Expanding bruising in the tissue pointed to malnutrition after the knock.', 'Spreading bruise after the knock pointed to poor nutrition from deficit, excess, or imbalance.', '撞击后组织内瘀斑扩大，指向营养不良。'),
