  ('e98eec69-3f61-57ad-a5ac-b8ea6985b801', 'The affected tissue showed virus together with the expected local reaction.', 'The tissue showed obligate intracellular infectious particle plus the expected local reaction.', '受累组织出现病毒，并伴有预期的局部反应。'),
