  ('9685d8d7-71fb-5f99-833d-b43cafaae603', 'Before transfer they had to diagnose the airway and document the result.', 'Before transfer they had to name the illness after history, exam, and tests the airway and write the result.', '转出前必须先对气道诊断并记录结果。'),
  ('73e88474-1504-58d1-9815-b9f1df14de25', 'At the bedside the main finding was paralysis, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was loss of the ability to move a part of the body.', '床旁的主要发现是麻痹，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('ea6e2ce2-983e-5136-8522-35c7cb856a97', 'New fever and a focal finding made venereal disease the working problem.', 'Fever plus a local finding made older name for a sexually transmitted infection the working problem.', '新发热加上局灶发现，把性病（旧称）列为当前问题。'),
  ('74f185c9-24a5-565d-9c01-b3fedcbc366e', 'The admission summary placed symptom with the early working problems.', 'The first summary listed change the patient feels or reports among the early problems.', '入院小结把症状放进初步问题。'),
  ('e55cf90e-0225-53da-aab3-894e00344712', 'Imaging was not needed; hepatitis was already clear at the bedside.', 'Bedside findings already showed inflammation of the liver.', '床旁已经能判断肝炎，不必再为这一炎症另做影像。'),
  ('83db5b11-a477-5e9b-8e0f-bc057ac03bbc', 'The host response in this tissue included sign.', 'The body’s response in this tissue included objective finding the examiner can detect.', '这片组织的宿主反应包括体征。'),
  ('83b7cf90-40f6-51f5-893f-52e7e234de85', 'The biopsy confirmed colitis and excluded a competing infection.', 'Tissue exam confirmed inflammation of the colon and ruled out another infection.', '活检证实了结肠炎，并排除了另一种感染。'),
  ('a4a25f6b-7fd2-5d39-bb7d-6c1099f33bbf', 'She remained symptomatic after the first doses of antipyretic.', 'After the first fever medicine she remained showing symptoms of a disease.', '首剂退热药之后，她仍是有症状的的。'),
  ('2420ed04-d872-5c0a-bf6a-cbbbdf8f5af2', 'The meter reading fitted cholera and explained the new confusion.', 'The glucose reading fitted acute diarrheal infection usually from contaminated water and explained the confusion.', '血糖读数符合霍乱，也解释了新出现的意识混乱。'),
  ('f7e9aa43-417e-5e9e-9a61-a0edaf4c5e65', 'Handover kept the wording asymptomatic so the night team would not soften it.', 'The outgoing team kept the precise word that means having no symptoms despite disease or carriage.', '交接时坚持用无症状的这个写法，避免夜班说得太软。'),
  ('c69ab796-18fc-5c5f-9786-b7ba2f38f7c3', 'Expanding bruising in the tissue pointed to typhoid fever after the knock.', 'Spreading bruise after the knock pointed to systemic Salmonella infection with prolonged fever.', '撞击后组织内瘀斑扩大，指向伤寒。'),
  ('77c946a8-7574-5615-81c0-e7333d9d1b08', 'Each acute disease in the tissue kept its usual working parts.', 'Each unit (illness that starts quickly and runs a short course) in the tissue kept its usual working parts.', '组织里的每个急性病仍保持通常的工作结构。'),
