  ('3f2066d4-daad-503e-a476-cdcaa25ec6fb', 'The injured region included the chronic disease and the structures next to it.', 'The injury involved this structure (illness that lasts a long time or recurs) and its neighbors.', '损伤范围包括慢性病及其邻近结构。'),
  ('9fd1ad3c-7d68-592a-a8e4-1e89b9e0a546', 'The affected tissue showed pimples together with the expected local reaction.', 'The tissue showed small raised inflammatory spots on the skin plus the expected local reaction.', '受累组织出现丘疹，并伴有预期的局部反应。'),
