  ('59125199-a5c3-5018-80ce-17c323a9f29b', 'The laboratory comment linked the numbers to pus.', 'The lab comment linked the numbers to thick infected fluid of dead cells and microbes.', '化验备注把这些数字和脓联系起来。'),
  ('aaaef3a8-ee68-5955-a79d-d64927fdedab', 'The first regimen was fatal rather than aimed at cure.', 'The first regimen was able to cause death rather than aimed at cure.', '第一方案是致命的的，而不是以根治为目标。'),
  ('fbb7bdaf-0ab0-5cfe-8189-766b9190b014', 'Histology confirmed abscess and named the cell type involved.', 'The tissue report confirmed localized pocket of pus and named the cell type.', '组织学证实了脓肿，并写明受累细胞类型。'),
