  ('7b1058d7-5860-5f39-b49e-87951b22efc1', 'A distant nodule made endemic disease more likely than a single local growth.', 'A nodule far from the first growth made disease constantly present in a defined region more likely.', '远处结节使地方病比单纯局部肿物更像。'),
