  ('53b4c2ef-c952-5565-906d-b397964eb9c8', 'Damaged tissue in this organ showed airborne droplets rather than simple swelling.', 'The damaged organ showed infection spread by respiratory droplets in the air, not just swelling.', '该器官的损伤组织表现为飞沫传播，而不是单纯肿胀。'),
