  ('b7029ae1-87d8-5c12-a754-4d6a8e55cd10', 'After opsonization coated the microbe, phagocytes could ingest it much more easily.', 'A protein coat on the microbe made it easier for eating-cells to take it up.', '调理作用给微生物表面涂上标记后，吞噬细胞就更容易把它吞入。'),
