  ('ebbb06d2-06e9-51db-90ea-57c9ff6b6244', 'At the bedside the main finding was uvula, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was small fleshy tag hanging from the soft palate.', '床旁的主要发现是腭垂；悬雍垂，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
