  ('d4771483-6e77-5373-9efe-8b9c80ac2c7c', 'Fluid around the parotid gland explained the local tightness.', 'Extra fluid around this structure (large salivary gland in front of the ear) made the area tight.', '腮腺周围的液体解释了局部紧绷。'),
