  ('62bd7441-427e-502f-a980-4231a32bf45d', 'She reported the hepatic duct as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She reported duct carrying bile from the liver as the complaint that brought her in.', '她把肝管说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('d684b50a-7ea3-53d7-9e9e-bd8f14326493', 'Contents passed through the epiglottis without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (flap that covers the larynx during swallowing) without stalling.', '内容物通过会厌时没有滞留。'),
