  ('8038ad78-df7a-5a9c-9ef2-fa5bef44e03a', 'Neighboring tissue stayed intact beside the common bile duct.', 'Tissue next to this structure — duct that carries bile into the duodenum — was unhurt.', '胆总管旁边的邻近组织仍保持完整。'),
