  ('8bce982e-f1a2-5753-9c9f-341c7d424085', 'At the bedside the main finding was antrum, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was cavity, such as the gastric antrum.', '床旁的主要发现是窦；腔，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('0f842892-9666-57f7-9761-6748629ee576', 'The operation stayed clear of the bile acid whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (liver-made acids that help digest fat) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开胆汁酸。'),
  ('29228e77-661a-5a02-9e1f-a808269d6f5c', 'Rising white cells supported gingivitis once the local signs were present.', 'The white-cell rise backed inflammation of the gums after local signs appeared.', '局部体征出现后，白细胞升高支持牙龈炎。'),
