  ('f0918099-a3ae-5c93-9408-724e2c60005d', 'Contents passed through the pharyngeal tonsils without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (lymphoid tissue in the nasopharynx; adenoids) without stalling.', '内容物通过咽扁桃体时没有滞留。'),
  ('519da02a-ba3e-55ea-84f2-22fe9f8db0a3', 'In this tissue the thoracic cavity was the working unit that still mattered.', 'In this tissue chest cavity enclosed by ribs and diaphragm was the working unit that still mattered.', '在这片组织里，胸腔仍是起作用的单位。'),
  ('ba686ee2-011b-5ed7-b80a-391c959b56b0', 'Forward flow depended on the abdominal cavity staying adequate.', 'Forward flow depended on peritoneal cavity of the abdomen staying adequate.', '前向血流取决于腹腔是否足够。'),
  ('b9f11f45-fe65-595d-89c4-c66faa321c31', 'She reported the palatine tonsils as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She reported tonsils in the oropharynx as the complaint that brought her in.', '她把腭扁桃体说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('59cc42ab-70d4-5d53-aa3c-08b4c9a3c0b2', 'In this patient, inhalation explained the change in function.', 'Here, drawing air into the lungs explained why function changed.', '在该患者身上，吸气解释了功能为何改变。'),
  ('38dea84b-c519-5b49-a03d-bdf2ff661db7', 'Swelling around the tongue tonsil limited local movement.', 'Fluid around this structure (lymphoid tissue at the tongue base; lingual tonsil) made movement stiff.', '舌扁桃体周围肿胀，限制了局部活动。'),
  ('4a7375cd-a3ee-5176-a3bf-88d6c0ebb5b2', 'Blood supply to the vocal cords was still present on the scan.', 'The scan still showed flow to this structure (folds in the larynx that produce voice).', '扫描仍能看到声带的血供。'),
  ('358cc8ee-4bb1-5e73-a727-6711130f2cdc', 'The laboratory comment linked the numbers to exhalation.', 'The lab comment linked the numbers to pushing air out of the lungs.', '化验备注把这些数字和呼气联系起来。'),
  ('212bdf3d-c696-5bed-bd73-08d9047c0118', 'Pain mapped over the mucous membrane rather than a distant site.', 'The pain sat over this structure (lining that secretes mucus), not far away.', '疼痛定位在黏膜，而不是远处。'),
  ('d0d8e833-b105-553e-bc46-b579006d02be', 'Over the first night, brainstem remained the finding that directed care.', 'Through the first night, midbrain, pons, and medulla connecting brain to cord still directed care.', '第一夜里，仍是脑干在指导处理。'),
  ('4b95d2bd-97a2-56d1-897c-b17976dc2926', 'Fluid around the fibrous connective tissue explained the local tightness.', 'Extra fluid around this structure (dense connective tissue rich in collagen) made the area tight.', '纤维结缔组织周围的液体解释了局部紧绷。'),
  ('b552d0a6-a5e6-5625-ad74-a7087cee5249', 'The phrenic nerve was the landmark used to describe the nearby injury.', 'This structure (nerve that drives the diaphragm) was the landmark for the nearby injury.', '用膈神经作为标志来描述附近的损伤。'),
  ('2faee99d-e182-502a-8044-536ec531d07c', 'Function returned as the acid recovered with rest and time.', 'As this structure (proton donor that lowers pH) recovered, function came back.', '随着酸在休息中恢复，功能也回来了。'),
  ('b69a74d7-3095-5d06-8e84-4219ce9a2d74', 'Normal function in this region still depended on bronchi.', 'Normal function here still depended on two main airway branches from the trachea.', '该区域的正常功能仍依赖支气管。'),
  ('5665add3-7291-5bf4-8077-1794dc38104f', 'The admission exam described the acidity as unremarkable on that side.', 'The first exam called this structure (how acidic a fluid or tissue is) unremarkable on that side.', '入院查体写该侧酸度无明显异常。'),
  ('c75f43ff-031a-5190-8d2f-29fc3aed224e', 'Today’s picture of bronchiole was milder than yesterday’s.', 'Today’s picture of small airway distal to the bronchi was milder than yesterday’s.', '今天的细支气管比昨天轻。'),
  ('6da3046f-5fe3-5f51-80b8-e8a65f7681b4', 'Contents passed through the acidosis without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (process that lowers blood pH or bicarbonate) without stalling.', '内容物通过酸中毒时没有滞留。'),
  ('f26eec7d-4b13-5cfd-9d40-f50f7e7d7af9', 'The alkalinity still secreted enough product for basal needs.', 'This structure (how alkaline a fluid or tissue is) still made enough product for baseline needs.', '碱度仍能分泌足够产物满足基础需要。'),
  ('9cf5c74c-0016-5afd-83cb-d9e0c1f9dd7e', 'In the body this presented as alveoli rather than an unrelated distant change.', 'In the body this presented as tiny air sacs where gas exchange occurs, not an unrelated distant change.', '在体内，表现是肺泡，而不是无关的远处改变。'),
  ('b5607f0d-d9b5-5d73-b17a-09b05b2acfb5', 'Neighboring tissue stayed intact beside the alkali.', 'Tissue next to this structure — base that can neutralize acid — was unhurt.', '碱旁边的邻近组织仍保持完整。'),
  ('e9b01dd1-dbd9-598c-b54a-35c24fe04783', 'The injured region included the epithelium and the structures next to it.', 'The injury involved this structure (covering tissue of surfaces and glands) and its neighbors.', '损伤范围包括上皮及其邻近结构。'),
  ('58dbbb97-3af5-5ed0-9bbb-03e9d1bcce43', 'Swelling around the alkalosis limited local movement.', 'Fluid around this structure (process that raises blood pH or bicarbonate) made movement stiff.', '碱中毒周围肿胀，限制了局部活动。'),
  ('a3302b73-f9df-59af-8f4b-73db5ffd8515', 'The scan localized the parietal pleura before any later complication.', 'The scan localized pleural layer lining the chest wall before later complications.', '扫描在后续并发症出现前定位了壁层胸膜。'),
  ('0a44a48b-7fed-54a1-9e5c-afc8014f52b7', 'The laboratory comment linked the numbers to hyperventilation.', 'The lab comment linked the numbers to breathing faster or deeper than metabolic need.', '化验备注把这些数字和过度通气联系起来。'),
  ('8fcafd4f-d893-5374-b2ce-ba417c39d24f', 'The admission exam listed the visceral pleura with the other system findings.', 'The first exam listed pleural layer covering the lung with the other system findings.', '入院查体把脏层胸膜和其他系统发现写在一起。'),
  ('76d360d1-4523-59a9-a0f5-045412774832', 'Over the first night, hypoventilation remained the finding that directed care.', 'Through the first night, breathing too little for metabolic need still directed care.', '第一夜里，仍是通气不足在指导处理。'),
  ('a2edff07-4ba4-55d8-bd75-b00531a85c6a', 'Forward flow depended on the horizontal fissure staying adequate.', 'Forward flow depended on fissure separating the right upper and middle lobes staying adequate.', '前向血流取决于水平裂是否足够。'),
  ('554bd88d-a49d-5c9f-a42b-d5f50290430b', 'The mucus was the landmark used to describe the nearby injury.', 'This structure (sticky secretion of mucous glands) was the landmark for the nearby injury.', '用黏液作为标志来描述附近的损伤。'),
  ('9bde0500-f16d-58a0-847a-e586684d6e89', 'Once gas exchange failed, the oblique fissure had to be started.', 'Once gas exchange failed, fissure separating upper and lower lung lobes had to be started.', '气体交换失败后，必须开始斜裂。'),
  ('2985b86e-51c0-50bb-b190-309f66158671', 'New fever and a focal finding made pneumonia the working problem.', 'Fever plus a local finding made infection of the lung parenchyma the working problem.', '新发热加上局灶发现，把肺炎列为当前问题。'),
  ('357d322b-d6c6-5e50-b4c4-0955e8562c4c', 'The admission exam described the exudates as unremarkable on that side.', 'The first exam called this structure (protein-rich fluid leaking from inflamed vessels) unremarkable on that side.', '入院查体写该侧渗出液无明显异常。'),
  ('cfec0bab-2d96-5e58-be8c-826410840693', 'Histology confirmed tuberculosis and named the cell type involved.', 'The tissue report confirmed infection with Mycobacterium tuberculosis and named the cell type.', '组织学证实了结核病，并写明受累细胞类型。'),
  ('e786feb0-573d-5252-aea8-b2250e5f5679', 'Contents passed through the solidification without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (lung tissue becoming firm, as in consolidation) without stalling.', '内容物通过实变时没有滞留。'),
  ('ff2a2715-f46a-5743-89c2-6fafb27eefdb', 'The progress line mentioned asthma in one plain sentence.', 'The progress line used one plain sentence for reversible airway obstruction with inflammation and spasm.', '病程用一句平实的话写到了哮喘。'),
  ('773150ad-2317-542d-8d08-5e3d8033779d', 'In the body this presented as consolidation rather than an unrelated distant change.', 'In the body this presented as airless lung filled with exudate, as in pneumonia, not an unrelated distant change.', '在体内，表现是实变，而不是无关的远处改变。'),
  ('3a9942f3-5a64-56bd-b58f-5d83ff7574ab', 'The finding was allergic on examination.', 'On exam the finding was caused by or relating to allergy.', '查体时该发现是过敏的的。'),
  ('285d6a82-bd53-5824-8f64-f20e6bdd766d', 'In this patient, dyspnea explained the change in function.', 'Here, sensation of difficult or labored breathing explained why function changed.', '在该患者身上，呼吸困难解释了功能为何改变。'),
  ('507ab76e-5159-5e4f-9332-c2a0e297bd0b', 'Expanding bruising in the tissue pointed to emphysema after the knock.', 'Spreading bruise after the knock pointed to destruction of alveolar walls with air trapping.', '撞击后组织内瘀斑扩大，指向肺气肿。'),
  ('82bb5ccb-2431-506d-a213-b1a9611036e1', 'The scan description named cyanosis in the region of interest.', 'The scan named bluish skin or mucosa from low oxygenated hemoglobin in the region of interest.', '扫描描述在兴趣区写到了发绀。'),
  ('163e3c58-0f86-55a3-ad12-c10916add2e9', 'The overnight chart recorded influenza after the new vital-sign change.', 'The night chart named acute viral respiratory infection after the new vital-sign change.', '生命体征出现新变化后，夜间病程记录了流行性感冒。'),
  ('d410e888-d482-5851-a4a2-afdf550b3b43', 'At the bedside the main finding was wheeze, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was high-pitched whistling sound from narrowed airways.', '床旁的主要发现是哮鸣，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('6df5da18-279e-5be9-b5fe-84353685aafb', 'Fever and local pain marked pneumonitis in the affected organ.', 'Heat and pain showed inflammation of lung tissue, not always infectious.', '发热和局部疼痛提示受累器官发生了肺炎（广义）；肺炎症。'),
  ('9dca5d3f-0040-5550-baae-fc07d55ee50b', 'The medication list kept steroids with the indication beside it.', 'The drug list kept this medicine (corticosteroid drugs that suppress inflammation) and why it was given.', '用药清单保留甾体；糖皮质激素，并在旁边写明适应证。'),
  ('0280771f-706f-536c-93bf-e18818636e1c', 'The case note named the lobar pneumonia before describing what happened next.', 'The note first named pneumonia involving a whole lobe, then said what followed.', '病历先写出大叶性肺炎，再写接下来发生了什么。'),
  ('209c9ad2-f435-5e19-96c7-9cb30c9586f6', 'Function returned as the allergen recovered with rest and time.', 'As this structure (substance that triggers allergy) recovered, function came back.', '随着变应原在休息中恢复，功能也回来了。'),
  ('c8b10455-ab04-5f70-a918-2bdd241d5a20', 'In the body, the polio is the structure that can paralyze.', 'In the body this is the structure that can paralyze.', '在体内，脊髓灰质炎就是承担这一功能的结构。'),
  ('41b3aab7-1fa0-508e-ba5f-08ac8e1d70e1', 'The discharge plan still had to account for bronchopneumonia.', 'The discharge plan still had to account for patchy pneumonia centered on bronchioles.', '出院计划仍需考虑支气管肺炎。'),
  ('681256b8-ff52-527e-82a8-f9f6dcefb4be', 'Before transfer they had to paralyze the airway and document the result.', 'Before transfer they had to take away the ability to move a part the airway and write the result.', '转出前必须先对气道使瘫痪并记录结果。'),
  ('1af4e318-8985-5d15-82e9-c461fa28b6f8', 'The discharge line kept pleurisy as the working inflammatory diagnosis.', 'The discharge summary still named inflammation of the pleura, often painful.', '出院小结仍把胸膜炎作为炎性工作诊断。'),
  ('fe4fe13c-ee4e-591e-bb0e-24b14adec6d0', 'The note asked whether the process was truly mature in this patient.', 'The note checked that the process really was fully developed here.', '病程在问：这个过程在该患者身上是否真的是成熟的的。'),
  ('bac3f4c6-150e-559f-81d3-d70630d03d32', 'In the body this presented as tubercle rather than an unrelated distant change.', 'In the body this presented as small rounded nodule, classically in tuberculosis, not an unrelated distant change.', '在体内，表现是结节；结核结节，而不是无关的远处改变。'),
  ('98fc47bb-c7d1-516c-836c-fe0b17bf9725', 'The drug was given prematurely according to the route the gut allowed.', 'The drug was given earlier than the expected time, according to what the gut allowed.', '根据肠道情况，药物过早地给予。'),
  ('85707daf-d35e-5fd8-bd0f-34f8ad550777', 'In this patient, hemoptysis explained the change in function.', 'Here, coughing up blood from the lower airway explained why function changed.', '在该患者身上，咯血解释了功能为何改变。'),
  ('a50fc51a-0db7-591e-930d-6725d5b1854e', 'The affected tissue showed digitalis together with the expected local reaction.', 'The tissue showed cardiac glycoside used for some heart failure and arrhythmia plus the expected local reaction.', '受累组织出现洋地黄，并伴有预期的局部反应。'),
  ('0d481607-939a-5ada-b668-3188aba96305', 'The scan description named phlegm in the region of interest.', 'The scan named thick mucus from the airways in the region of interest.', '扫描描述在兴趣区写到了痰。'),
  ('8bc8de95-f1dd-5b87-9c92-73eafc77506d', 'The diuretics lay in its usual position in this patient.', 'This structure (drugs that increase urine output) was where it normally sits.', '该患者体内的利尿剂仍在通常位置。'),
  ('f375a170-552b-5033-9190-c26c5a1332fb', 'At the bedside the main finding was atrium, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was upper receiving chamber of the heart.', '床旁的主要发现是心房，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('493cceff-41b4-5e2d-9cf7-9c62e1bf3dfd', 'The operation stayed clear of the bronchospasm whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (sudden narrowing of bronchi by smooth-muscle contraction) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开支气管痉挛。'),
  ('50b2c540-c09e-5c37-ab1c-dbdb29693967', 'The admission summary placed hypercapnia with the early working problems.', 'The first summary listed excess carbon dioxide in the blood among the early problems.', '入院小结把高碳酸血症放进初步问题。'),
  ('23b5415d-3686-5ddc-8dca-adbad78d56b7', 'Pain on swallowing accompanied simple chronic bronchitis of the local lining.', 'Swallowing hurt because of chronic bronchitis with cough and sputum but little obstruction.', '局部黏膜的单纯慢性支气管炎伴随着吞咽痛。'),
  ('51ed92cf-e457-5c3c-9b20-f35d945d1bb2', 'The host response in this tissue included pneumothorax.', 'The body’s response in this tissue included air in the pleural space collapsing the lung.', '这片组织的宿主反应包括气胸。'),
  ('0d02c005-453b-5fed-9113-fb356a64051a', 'Normal function in this region still depended on pneumoconiosis.', 'Normal function here still depended on lung disease from inhaled mineral dust.', '该区域的正常功能仍依赖尘肺。'),
  ('ecd707b3-c6bc-5c10-a241-97d919575a71', 'Tenderness over that region fitted chronic obstructive bronchitis rather than a distant problem.', 'Pressing there hurt in a way that fitted chronic bronchitis with airflow obstruction.', '该部位压痛更符合慢性阻塞性支气管炎，而不是远处病变。'),
  ('f332d63a-da1a-54eb-889e-cff341e98bf7', 'Today’s picture of silicosis was milder than yesterday’s.', 'Today’s picture of pneumoconiosis from silica dust was milder than yesterday’s.', '今天的矽肺比昨天轻。'),
  ('0e66c165-9b85-5f21-87fb-d84da6eb02a1', 'After the procedure, anthracosilicosis was the finding watched most closely.', 'After the procedure, pneumoconiosis from coal and silica dust was watched most closely.', '操作之后，最密切观察的是煤矽肺。'),
