  ('3ea6e960-091d-56d2-a721-9f65a55e7ddf', 'After fluids and the first doses, bronchitis began to settle.', 'inflammation of the bronchi started to ease after early treatment.', '补液和首剂药物之后，支气管炎开始回落。'),
  ('25b1228a-c3d1-5ed7-b892-0a242d77d8d5', 'The finding was noxious on examination.', 'On exam the finding was harmful to tissue or health.', '查体时该发现是有害的的。'),
  ('05ef2ce7-3e32-5221-987a-c80433d929b7', 'Damaged tissue in this organ showed bronchiectasis rather than simple swelling.', 'The damaged organ showed permanent abnormal widening of bronchi, not just swelling.', '该器官的损伤组织表现为支气管扩张，而不是单纯肿胀。'),
  ('8adeb74a-3d63-5232-ba9b-eb8b9f9af28f', 'Swelling around the atherosclerosis limited local movement.', 'Fluid around this structure (plaque buildup that narrows arteries) made movement stiff.', '动脉粥样硬化周围肿胀，限制了局部活动。'),
  ('08d913bd-ff68-568d-b8cc-377d042c43d2', 'The scan localized the systolic pressure before any later complication.', 'The scan localized arterial pressure during ventricular contraction before later complications.', '扫描在后续并发症出现前定位了收缩压。'),
  ('13fcbfd8-2d85-5ec1-8840-b6cd1824e451', 'Bedside measurements showed what the diastolic pressure was doing in real time.', 'Bedside numbers showed what arterial pressure during ventricular relaxation was doing in real time.', '床旁测量显示了舒张压当时的实际作用。'),
  ('190c163e-1d9e-51ba-a53f-9cecc2b93050', 'Pain mapped over the lumen rather than a distant site.', 'The pain sat over this structure (inner open space of a tubular organ), not far away.', '疼痛定位在管腔，而不是远处。'),
  ('f4db3cb4-8e7c-5f1f-8af4-a5a91aa9f74d', 'In this tissue the congestive heart failure was the working unit that still mattered.', 'In this tissue heart failure with fluid backup in lungs or body was the working unit that still mattered.', '在这片组织里，充血性心力衰竭仍是起作用的单位。'),
  ('389f3f8f-93b4-5c3a-949c-7e43ccdbe784', 'Fluid around the ischemia explained the local tightness.', 'Extra fluid around this structure (insufficient blood flow to a tissue) made the area tight.', '缺血周围的液体解释了局部紧绷。'),
  ('6b3c4179-0ca1-54c3-9046-2226edc15146', 'She reported the coronary heart disease as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She reported atherosclerotic disease of the coronary arteries as the complaint that brought her in.', '她把冠心病说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('733034a9-7cca-54ae-8054-1abb1bcdb17e', 'The host response in this tissue included vegetation.', 'The body’s response in this tissue included clot-like mass on a valve, as in endocarditis.', '这片组织的宿主反应包括赘生物。'),
  ('c03dacf8-cc07-5998-9984-26aafedd8f44', 'The laboratory value for the angina pectoris moved with the clinical change.', 'The laboratory value for chest pain from myocardial ischemia moved with the clinical change.', '心绞痛的化验数值随临床变化而动。'),
  ('2c8c556b-681e-5458-833a-4725b42d3ae5', 'The discharge advice still mentioned the essential hypertension in plain language.', 'The discharge advice still mentioned high blood pressure without an identified secondary cause in plain language.', '出院医嘱仍用明白的话提到原发性高血压。'),
  ('cae70a3f-1e92-5126-a218-360d105aeb1a', 'Today’s picture of clot was milder than yesterday’s.', 'Today’s picture of mass of coagulated blood was milder than yesterday’s.', '今天的血凝块比昨天轻。'),
  ('6c83e093-5cfa-528a-be11-549f63118fad', 'Contents passed through the thrombosis without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (formation of a clot inside a vessel) without stalling.', '内容物通过血栓形成时没有滞留。'),
  ('05fdff18-1a32-5908-91a5-8fd43e86dabb', 'The overnight chart kept the secondary hypertension on its own line.', 'The night chart kept high blood pressure caused by another disease on its own line.', '夜间病程给继发性高血压单独留了一行。'),
  ('f29e5812-643a-590e-8bd0-3c858106b81e', 'Each thrombus in the tissue kept its usual working parts.', 'Each unit (clot formed in situ inside a vessel or heart) in the tissue kept its usual working parts.', '组织里的每个血栓仍保持通常的工作结构。'),
  ('c8e730b6-4779-5f11-b902-4aa732251bf9', 'Neighboring tissue stayed intact beside the myocardial infarction.', 'Tissue next to this structure — death of heart muscle from blocked coronary flow — was unhurt.', '心肌梗死旁边的邻近组织仍保持完整。'),
  ('c5a07047-969a-5f3a-a0a2-d4d77b0b5c1f', 'The overnight note listed endocarditis after the new fever and focal findings.', 'The night chart named inflammation of the inner lining of the heart once fever and a local finding appeared.', '夜间病程在新发热和局灶发现后写下了心内膜炎。'),
  ('006b75de-2301-525a-a1ef-b8dc1d43d2b1', 'In this tissue the pericardial tamponade was the working unit that still mattered.', 'In this tissue compression of the heart by fluid in the pericardium was the working unit that still mattered.', '在这片组织里，心包填塞仍是起作用的单位。'),
  ('cb08b78c-4216-5860-9c2d-c5cf551272a6', 'The scan description named arhythmia in the region of interest.', 'The scan named irregular heartbeat (textbook spelling of arrhythmia) in the region of interest.', '扫描描述在兴趣区写到了心律失常。'),
  ('8a91ca2d-f259-551b-bd8d-889ee726fb0b', 'The fibrillation lay in its usual position in this patient.', 'This structure (rapid, uncoordinated muscle twitching, as in AF or VF) was where it normally sits.', '该患者体内的纤颤仍在通常位置。'),
