  ('018e223a-68b9-50e3-b07c-63a206937463', 'The scan localized the medulla oblongata before any later complication.', 'The scan localized lowest brainstem, continuous with the spinal cord before later complications.', '扫描在后续并发症出现前定位了延髓。'),
  ('618fc82b-768a-5851-b4ad-c361d4c4f6b3', 'The afferent plane divided the region as the scan described.', 'This plane (carrying impulses toward a center) divided the region as the scan described.', '扫描所示的传入的平面把该区域分开。'),
  ('377d8182-10ba-5721-9a50-a38b0184c64f', 'At the bedside the main finding was meninx, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was one of the meninges covering brain or cord.', '床旁的主要发现是脑膜，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('f7395ad1-a29d-5272-8116-7e13bcc16b3a', 'The parasympathetic findings explained the main complaint in this admission.', 'Findings about the rest-and-digest autonomic division explained the main complaint.', '这些副交感的发现解释了此次入院的主诉。'),
  ('fc1db592-75a7-5127-8b60-f43c45c3ae58', 'Forward flow depended on the cauda equina staying adequate.', 'Forward flow depended on bundle of lumbar and sacral roots below the cord staying adequate.', '前向血流取决于马尾是否足够。'),
  ('f8b94828-74e5-5850-9bf5-26d657973177', 'Night handover named dura before the checks that followed.', 'The night team named tough outer meninx; dura mater before the later checks.', '夜班交接先提到硬膜，再讲后续核对。'),
  ('617e059d-53e2-59b6-a8b6-8112b561efcb', 'The sympathetic imaging correlated with the bedside signs.', 'Imaging of the fight-or-flight autonomic division matched the bedside signs.', '交感的影像与床旁体征相符。'),
  ('051b6370-e95e-58df-a657-708892ed50e6', 'Normal function in this region still depended on mater.', 'Normal function here still depended on mater in dura/pia/arachnoid mater, a meningeal layer.', '该区域的正常功能仍依赖膜（脑脊膜）。'),
  ('d1e5c68a-c24f-5258-8c12-ae479e937184', 'The discharge plan still had to account for arachnoid.', 'The discharge plan still had to account for middle meningeal layer.', '出院计划仍需考虑蛛网膜。'),
  ('dd33f64d-2c5d-5511-b50d-1b3a46dcc7ae', 'Today’s picture of ganglion was milder than yesterday’s.', 'Today’s picture of cluster of nerve-cell bodies outside the CNS was milder than yesterday’s.', '今天的神经节比昨天轻。'),
  ('557e3685-43bb-59a2-b330-16dec67fb13e', 'In the body, the pia mater kept its usual role during the acute illness.', 'In the body, delicate inner meninx on the brain and cord surface kept its usual role during the acute illness.', '急性病期间，体内的软膜仍发挥通常作用。'),
  ('2c1eb157-684e-57f2-878a-7e30e3aa6362', 'The plexus still secreted enough product for basal needs.', 'This structure (network of nerves or vessels) still made enough product for baseline needs.', '丛仍能分泌足够产物满足基础需要。'),
  ('d9d5c165-ede2-5d48-a18e-ddc656d844bb', 'The scan localized the lumbar puncture before any later complication.', 'The scan localized needle sampling of CSF in the lumbar sac before later complications.', '扫描在后续并发症出现前定位了腰椎穿刺。'),
  ('01513836-f4ef-5deb-beff-5059182f7265', 'Neighboring tissue stayed intact beside the dendrite.', 'Tissue next to this structure — branching process that receives synaptic input — was unhurt.', '树突旁边的邻近组织仍保持完整。'),
  ('660ef609-5cff-5d15-b44f-2357849ef978', 'The injured region included the electrical charge and the structures next to it.', 'The injury involved this structure (charged state that underlies nerve action potentials) and its neighbors.', '损伤范围包括电荷及其邻近结构。'),
  ('560725b5-5ff6-54ec-88bc-55a04ae33034', 'Swelling around the axon limited local movement.', 'Fluid around this structure (long process that carries a nerve impulse away) made movement stiff.', '轴突周围肿胀，限制了局部活动。'),
  ('b4049f08-da7e-5627-8d0e-9de12527c710', 'The scan description named myelin in the region of interest.', 'The scan named insulating sheath around many axons in the region of interest.', '扫描描述在兴趣区写到了髓鞘质。'),
  ('aaf39cba-1b55-5dc2-907f-6d90811067b7', 'The laboratory comment linked the numbers to neurilemma.', 'The lab comment linked the numbers to Schwann-cell sheath around a peripheral axon.', '化验备注把这些数字和神经膜联系起来。'),
  ('4da98763-9a83-5dc1-98de-521ca876da85', 'At the bedside the main finding was synapse, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was junction where one neuron signals another.', '床旁的主要发现是突触，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('297920bd-f719-57f9-955d-f57c2276c23d', 'The operation stayed clear of the white matter whenever possible.', 'Surgery avoided this structure (CNS tissue rich in myelinated axons) when it could.', '手术尽可能避开白质。'),
  ('834da682-e5e7-5bc4-b547-d30a8ce07211', 'Fluid around the gray matter explained the local tightness.', 'Extra fluid around this structure (CNS tissue rich in cell bodies) made the area tight.', '灰质周围的液体解释了局部紧绷。'),
  ('7d30ee10-d652-59a7-8246-6eceb9b2b5d3', 'Night handover named neurotransmitter before the checks that followed.', 'The night team named chemical signal released at a synapse before the later checks.', '夜班交接先提到神经递质，再讲后续核对。'),
  ('dd3d89b8-3556-59ff-958d-08695057883a', 'The host response in this tissue included neuroglia.', 'The body’s response in this tissue included supporting cells of the nervous system.', '这片组织的宿主反应包括神经胶质。'),
  ('93175881-ff10-5e97-a2cf-4b1392fb838d', 'Normal function in this region still depended on astrocyte.', 'Normal function here still depended on star-shaped glial cell of the CNS.', '该区域的正常功能仍依赖星形胶质细胞。'),
  ('ac3ec2af-c7be-5e4d-a639-ae538e6dde10', 'The discharge summary kept glioma among the principal diagnoses.', 'The discharge summary still listed tumor of glial cells as a main diagnosis.', '出院小结把胶质瘤留在主要诊断里。'),
  ('a46c6749-f2a3-5779-9b0f-01890c4eaee9', 'Today’s picture of microglia was milder than yesterday’s.', 'Today’s picture of resident immune cells of the CNS was milder than yesterday’s.', '今天的小胶质细胞比昨天轻。'),
  ('d8ec1497-dc8d-5009-a42f-f754240494fb', 'Contents passed through the oligodendroglia without hold-up.', 'Material moved through this structure (CNS cells that form myelin) without stalling.', '内容物通过少突胶质细胞时没有滞留。'),
  ('2925a072-ddd6-5b46-8bfe-23e613300f25', 'The progress line mentioned cerebrum in one plain sentence.', 'The progress line used one plain sentence for large paired hemispheres of the brain.', '病程用一句平实的话写到了大脑。'),
  ('d2e94e1a-45fe-5180-83ab-7c731b897128', 'In the body this presented as convolution rather than an unrelated distant change.', 'In the body this presented as gyrus; a fold of the cerebral cortex, not an unrelated distant change.', '在体内，表现是脑回，而不是无关的远处改变。'),
  ('aea12f5d-8ed5-58c8-af38-9c5be9c55738', 'She reported the peripheral nervous system as the complaint that brought her in.', 'She reported nerves and ganglia outside the brain and cord as the complaint that brought her in.', '她把周围神经系统说成促使就诊的主诉。'),
  ('cb1165ca-75c2-58f4-ad85-8e463d3c8bf7', 'Once gas exchange failed, the autonomic nervous system had to be started.', 'Once gas exchange failed, involuntary visceral motor system had to be started.', '气体交换失败后，必须开始自主神经系统。'),
  ('1f244ab9-19ed-5bd8-9c2a-81508c14bb07', 'Swelling around the visceral nervous system limited local movement.', 'Fluid around this structure (nerves supplying internal organs) made movement stiff.', '内脏神经系统周围肿胀，限制了局部活动。'),
  ('8852fad9-485c-534b-9533-e640c6b3059b', 'Blood supply to the groove was still present on the scan.', 'The scan still showed flow to this structure (shallow furrow on a bone or organ surface).', '扫描仍能看到沟的血供。'),
  ('4a27dba8-4656-5f6d-a826-e686addc8448', 'The laboratory comment linked the numbers to fissure.', 'The lab comment linked the numbers to deeper cleft, as between cerebral hemispheres.', '化验备注把这些数字和裂联系起来。'),
  ('20ae6df3-4f73-5676-8fc9-bb5bf9cbc6bc', 'At the bedside the main finding was sulcus, not a looser everyday word.', 'At the bedside the precise finding was groove between gyri of the cortex.', '床旁的主要发现是沟，而不是更含糊的日常说法。'),
  ('530e5656-4263-501a-8e28-d066a1e3ebbf', 'Over the first night, thalamus remained the finding that directed care.', 'Through the first night, diencephalic relay for sensory pathways to cortex still directed care.', '第一夜里，仍是丘脑在指导处理。')
) as v(id, context_sentence, plain_english_paraphrase, sentence_translation_zh)
where c.id = v.id::uuid;

